@startuml
!theme plain

title Guest Trending Posts Sequence - GET /api/v1/discovery/hashtags/trending & /api/v1/discovery/hashtags/{hashtag}/posts

autonumber

actor Guest
participant DiscoveryController
participant GetTrendingHashtagsUseCase
participant GetTrendingHashtagsService
database PostRepository
participant ContentAnalysisService
participant GetPostsByHashtagUseCase
participant GetPostsByHashtagService

group Fetch Trending Hashtags
  Guest -> DiscoveryController: GET /api/v1/discovery/hashtags/trending?days=7&limit=10
  DiscoveryController -> GetTrendingHashtagsUseCase: getTrendingHashtags(days, limit)
  GetTrendingHashtagsUseCase -> GetTrendingHashtagsService: getTrendingHashtags(days, limit)
  
  GetTrendingHashtagsService -> PostRepository: findRecentPublicActiveSince(sinceTime)
  PostRepository --> GetTrendingHashtagsService: List<Post>
  
  loop for each public active post
    GetTrendingHashtagsService -> ContentAnalysisService: extractHashtags(content)
    ContentAnalysisService --> GetTrendingHashtagsService: List<String> hashtags
  end
  
  GetTrendingHashtagsService -> GetTrendingHashtagsService: Group & count occurrences\nSort by frequency descending
  GetTrendingHashtagsService --> GetTrendingHashtagsUseCase: List<TrendingHashtagResponse>
  GetTrendingHashtagsUseCase --> DiscoveryController: List<TrendingHashtagResponse>
  DiscoveryController --> Guest: 200 OK\nApiResponse<List<TrendingHashtagResponse>>
end

group Fetch Posts under Trending Hashtag
  Guest -> DiscoveryController: GET /api/v1/discovery/hashtags/{hashtag}/posts?page=0&size=20
  DiscoveryController -> GetPostsByHashtagUseCase: getPostsByHashtag(hashtag, page, size)
  GetPostsByHashtagUseCase -> GetPostsByHashtagService: getPostsByHashtag(hashtag, page, size)
  
  GetPostsByHashtagService -> PostRepository: findByHashtagAndActive(hashtag, pageable)
  PostRepository --> GetPostsByHashtagService: Page<PostEntity>
  
  GetPostsByHashtagService --> GetPostsByHashtagUseCase: PageResponse<UserPostResponse>
  GetPostsByHashtagUseCase --> DiscoveryController: PageResponse<UserPostResponse>
  DiscoveryController --> Guest: 200 OK\nApiResponse<PageResponse<UserPostResponse>>
end

@enduml
